    "readme": [
      "steamledger database",
      "=================",
      "",
      "This folder is your Steam archive. Everything in it is a plain file that",
      "opens with a double click, and nothing in it needs an internet connection.",
      "",
      "  index.html         every snapshot, with links to its report",
      "  latest/            the newest snapshot, always at the same path",
      "  archive/<date>/    every snapshot, kept for later review",
      "  changes/           comparisons saved with: steamledger diff <older> <newer> --save",
      "  media/             avatars, game icons and achievement icons for offline viewing",
      "  cache/             Steam API cache; safe to delete",
      "",
      "Inside a snapshot folder:",
      "",
      "  report.html        a readable summary (report.tr.html in Turkish)",
      "  *.json             the data as collected",
      "  *.csv              the same tables for spreadsheets (UTF-8)",
      "  changes.json       what changed since the snapshot before it",
      "  meta.json          when it was taken and which parts Steam shared",
      "",
      "Your API key is never written to this folder. It stays in config.json."
    ]
  },
